    <string name="tpl_11a006ee">y = %1$sx %2$s 的 y 轴截距是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_98d506d9">y 轴截距就是 x = 0 时的 y 值: y = %1$s。\n斜率是 %2$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_a90c36e4">向量 (%1$s, %2$s) 与 (%3$s, %4$s) 的数量积是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_896140d8">数量积 = x₁x₂ + y₁y₂ = %1$s×%2$s + %3$s×%4$s = %5$s + %6$s = %7$s</string>
    <string name="tpl_f47fb815">长 %1$s 厘米、宽 %2$s 厘米、高 %3$s 厘米的长方体体积是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_4784c950">体积 = 长 × 宽 × 高 = %1$s × %2$s × %3$s = %4$s cm³</string>
    <string name="tpl_c2343df6">长 %1$s 厘米、宽 %2$s 厘米、高 %3$s 厘米的长方体表面积是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_6584d973">表面积 = 2 × (%1$s×%2$s + %3$s×%4$s + %5$s×%6$s) = 2 × %7$s = %8$s cm²</string>
    <string name="tpl_b34194c1">%1$s 个十和 %2$s 个一是多少?</string>
